# Lot Anomaly Manager Implementation Plan

> **For agentic workers:** REQUIRED SUB-SKILL: Use superpowers:subagent-driven-development (recommended) or superpowers:executing-plans to implement this plan task-by-task. Steps use checkbox (`- [ ]`) syntax for tracking.

**Goal:** Build an extensible server-side anomaly detection module for lots, exposed via a dedicated API endpoint, with alert banners displayed on the lot detail page.

**Architecture:** A `server/usecases/anomalies/` module contains independent detector functions registered in an orchestrator. A new `GET /api/lots/[o2i]/anomalies` endpoint runs all detectors and returns `LotAnomaly[]`. The frontend `LotAnomalyBanner` component fetches anomalies in parallel and renders one `UAlert` per anomaly inside the lot header card.

**Tech Stack:** Nuxt 4, H3/Nitro server routes, Drizzle ORM (read-only queries), Vue 3 Composition API, NuxtUI v4 `UAlert`

