## Extensibility Guide

To add a new anomaly type:

1. Create `server/usecases/anomalies/my-new-detector.ts` exporting a function `(context: AnomalyContext) => LotAnomaly[]`
2. Import and add it to the `detectors` array in `server/usecases/anomalies/index.ts`
3. If the detector needs new data, extend `AnomalyContext` in `server/usecases/anomalies/types.ts` and update the endpoint to fetch it
